WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.443
Salom!

2
00:00:00.443 --> 00:00:05.317
Tashqi manbasiz elektr zanjirida ikki xil tebranish rejimi bo‘lsa,

3
00:00:05.317 --> 00:00:09.231
ularning yig‘indisi ham mumkin bo‘lgan rejim bo‘ladi.

4
00:00:09.231 --> 00:00:13.662
Bu chiziqli tenglamalarning asosiy xossasi — superpozitsiya.

5
00:00:13.662 --> 00:00:19.718
Bugun uni aniq ta’riflaymiz va yechim mavjud bo‘lgan oraliqni topishni o‘rganamiz.

6
00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:23.668
Chiziqli tenglamani L y teng f ko‘rinishida yozamiz,

7
00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:30.499
bunda L — y ning n-hosilasi va undan past hosilalarning x ga bog‘liq koeffitsiyentli yig‘indisi.

8
00:00:30.499 --> 00:00:36.975
L chiziqli: ikki funksiya kombinatsiyasiga ta’siri natijalarning shu kombinatsiyasiga teng.

9
00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:43.094
f nol bo‘lsa, tenglama bir jinsli deyiladi — bu “bir jinsli” so‘zining boshqa ma’nosi.

10
00:00:43.344 --> 00:00:48.754
Misol: x kvadrat y ikki shtrix minus ikki y teng nol, x musbat.

11
00:00:48.754 --> 00:00:53.734
x kvadrat yechim: ikki x kvadrat minus ikki x kvadrat nol.

12
00:00:53.734 --> 00:01:03.180
Bir bo‘lingan x ham yechim: x kvadrat ko‘paytirilgan ikki bo‘lingan x kub, minus ikki bo‘lingan x, nolga teng.

13
00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:09.878
Superpozitsiya bo‘yicha C bir x kvadrat qo‘shuv C ikki bo‘lingan x ham yechim.

14
00:01:10.128 --> 00:01:15.528
Endi y birda bir, y shtrix birda besh shartlarini qo‘yamiz.

15
00:01:15.528 --> 00:01:21.478
C bir qo‘shuv C ikki teng bir, ikki C bir minus C ikki teng besh.

16
00:01:21.478 --> 00:01:27.519
Qo‘shsak, uch C bir teng olti, demak C bir ikki, C ikki minus bir.

17
00:01:27.519 --> 00:01:32.187
Javob: y teng ikki x kvadrat minus bir bo‘lingan x.

18
00:01:32.187 --> 00:01:37.862
Sistemaning determinanti minus uch — bu Vronskianning qiymati.

19
00:01:38.112 --> 00:01:45.880
Chiziqli tenglama uchun muhim natija: agar koeffitsiyentlar va o‘ng tomon oraliqda uzluksiz bo‘lsa,

20
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:50.823
Koshi masalasining yechimi butun shu oraliqda mavjud va yagona.

21
00:01:50.823 --> 00:01:57.178
Shuning uchun avval bosh koeffitsiyentga bo‘lamiz va uzilish nuqtalarini topamiz.

22
00:01:57.178 --> 00:02:02.514
Masalan, x kvadrat minus to‘rt, ko‘paytirilgan y ikki shtrix bo‘lsa,

23
00:02:02.514 --> 00:02:05.966
x teng ikki va minus ikki — xavfli nuqtalar.

24
00:02:06.216 --> 00:02:16.938
Grafikda ikki fundamental yechim — x kvadrat va bir bo‘lingan x — hamda topilgan yechim ikki x kvadrat minus bir bo‘lingan x ko‘rsatilgan.

25
00:02:16.938 --> 00:02:25.406
Uchinchi egri chiziq birinchi ikkitasining chiziqli kombinatsiyasi va x teng birda qiymati bir, og‘ishi besh.

26
00:02:25.656 --> 00:02:31.211
O‘zingizni tekshiring: superpozitsiya qaysi tenglamalar uchun to‘g‘ri?

27
00:02:31.211 --> 00:02:33.830
Javobni tanlang va izohni o‘qing.
